{"4131930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Silent Trip: Until We Meet", "steam_appid": 4131930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131930/extras/4b8532fe94bbb18471a2ccfa2189431c.poster.avif?t=1787220939\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131930/extras/4b8532fe94bbb18471a2ccfa2189431c.webm?t=1787220939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131930/extras/4b8532fe94bbb18471a2ccfa2189431c.mp4?t=1787220939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Trip: Until We Meet is an interactive story full of twists about two people trying to cope with anxiety, memories, and the silence between words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adam feels safe when he looks down.<br>Hawa feels safe when she says, &quot;I'm sorry.&quot;<br>They don't meet in person, but through a screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a source of comfort slowly transforms into something deeper. Through messages, moments, and silence, you will determine how their story unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meaningful Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide conversations and decisions that influence the direction of their relationship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emotional &amp; Psychological Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic tale about anxiety, memories, and human connections.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intimate Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience moments of silence, unspoken feelings, and the pauses between responses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different choices lead to different outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Presentation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between different perspectives as the story progresses.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131930/extras/4b8532fe94bbb18471a2ccfa2189431c.poster.avif?t=1787220939\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131930/extras/4b8532fe94bbb18471a2ccfa2189431c.webm?t=1787220939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131930/extras/4b8532fe94bbb18471a2ccfa2189431c.mp4?t=1787220939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Trip: Until We Meet is an interactive story full of twists about two people trying to cope with anxiety, memories, and the silence between words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adam feels safe when he looks down.<br>Hawa feels safe when she says, &quot;I'm sorry.&quot;<br>They don't meet in person, but through a screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a source of comfort slowly transforms into something deeper. Through messages, moments, and silence, you will determine how their story unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meaningful Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide conversations and decisions that influence the direction of their relationship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emotional &amp; Psychological Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic tale about anxiety, memories, and human connections.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intimate Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience moments of silence, unspoken feelings, and the pauses between responses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different choices lead to different outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Presentation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between different perspectives as the story progresses.</p>", "short_description": "A story-rich interactive fiction about two people who find comfort in each other, and the quiet things they never say out loud.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131930/dfa1f640fe99840b30a6d1834c67c9fa339119d4/header.jpg?t=1787220939", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131930/e0c27477ba55030cce92cfdcfc1a8c6c4ee7552f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787220939", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131930/e0c27477ba55030cce92cfdcfc1a8c6c4ee7552f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787220939", "website": "https://bawangstudio.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or above (64-bit Operating System Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 (3.1GHz) or AMD Phenom X4 945 (3.0GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 650 2GB or AMD Radeon HD 7770 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3470, (3.20 Ghz) or AMD FX-8350, (4.00 Ghz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970 4GB or AMD Radeon R9 280X 3GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "ma